   "atMs": 0,
   "durationMs": 29520,
   "script": "I almost gave up on the pens when I hit the plateau. But I got lucky and found the OzemPro app, and it helped me see what I was doing wrong. On the chart I saw the flat line, and I saw I wasn't hitting my protein goal for the day. I started taking a picture of my plate. And it works out how much protein, fiber and fat is in the meal. And the part I was most afraid of: counting the marks. I type in the vial and the dose, and it shows me exactly how far to pull so I don't get it wrong. I log the spot where I applied it, and it tells me the day of my next shot. No more wondering which side I used last week. I left the link down below for you to download the app. Don't waste time."
  },
